id: god-of-peace
name: God of Peace
order: 1
optionOf: divine-magic
description: >
  Enter the Mindful State until the start of your next turn.
text: >
  God of Peace [Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Enter the Mindful State until the start of your next turn.

---

# Offered in a window as the Power Up Maneuver is used, to tick then and there (chat.mjs answerPower).
[triggered/power, 1/round, effect 3]
enterState("mindful", 1, "start-of-next-turn");
